## Handbook XML (docs build)

Author under `src/afw/doc/**/*.xml`. Supported inline tags include **`literal`**, **`strong`**, **`italic`** — not DocBook **`emphasis`** (afwdev logs `Unknown element: emphasis` on `./afwdev build --all` / `--docs`). See `_afwdev/build/docs/docs.py`.

